{"parse": {"title": "无路可返-03", "pageid": 140189, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A0%E8%B7%AF%E5%8F%AF%E8%BF%94-02\" title=\"无路可返-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">无路可返-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A0%E8%B7%AF%E5%8F%AF%E8%BF%94-04\" title=\"无路可返-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">无路可返</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.88.86.E5.B8.83.E5.BC.8F.E7.A5.9E.E7.BB.8F.E8.8A.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"分布式神经节\">分布式神经节</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 分布式神经节</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Ganglionic Control</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_youlundating1\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_youlundating1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“莉莉”：</div><div>非常感谢您今天也邀请了我，蒙巴顿先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-534302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-534302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-534302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蒙巴顿：</div><div>不用谢，莉莉小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-534302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-534302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-534302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蒙巴顿：</div><div>如果我能更早知道布劳恩有女儿，我早就要他把人带来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-534302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-534302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-534302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蒙巴顿：</div><div>你说呢，布劳恩？为什么你不让同僚知道你早就结婚了，还有如此可爱的女儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-534402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-534402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-534402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">布劳恩：</div><div>呃，因为……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“莉莉”：</div><div>哼，让我说吧，爸爸，你之前都忙着和工作上的女同僚结盟，所以你故意假装单身对不对？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-534402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-534402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-534402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">布劳恩：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“莉莉”：</div><div>不需要装傻，妈妈早就知道了，她只是什么都不说而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“莉莉”：</div><div>谢天谢地你们没能合作，否则我们的家庭早就落入无法挽回的境地了，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-534402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-534402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-534402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">布劳恩：</div><div>啊，对，这是我的错……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-534302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-534302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-534302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蒙巴顿：</div><div>哈哈哈……怪不得你今天这么紧张，我还在想你到底有什么事瞒着我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-534302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-534302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-534302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蒙巴顿：</div><div>抱歉让你尴尬了，布劳恩，但这是你应得的，以后可得好好补偿你的家人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-534302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-534302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-534302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蒙巴顿：</div><div>至于你，人小鬼大的莉莉小姐，我和你父亲还有些话要聊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-534302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-534302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-534302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蒙巴顿：</div><div>在晚宴正式开始之前，你想不想去休息室见识下我从“新巴别塔”买来的仙人掌猫？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“莉莉”：</div><div>真的？！我当然要去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>天蛾人都是潜伏大师，尤其擅长伪装成人混入社会，我想这也是少有人能发现它们的原因。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>忘掉你的名字，你不再是你父母的孩子了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>你可以成为任何人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>他们教会我怎么扮成他人，而我把这些用到了基金会的间谍工作中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>没有人怀疑布劳恩拙劣的演技，所有人都相信这是他羞于谈论自己家事的表现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>更没有人怀疑“莉莉”这个到处乱闯的小女孩，蒙巴顿先生也没有注意到握手时产生的飞蛾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>等到蒙巴顿先生的佣人发现保险箱被打开过时，康斯坦丁女士已经在阅读他的小秘密了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>所以这就是你作为间谍的第一个间谍任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>不过你好像略过了一部分——你是如何加入基金会的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>这部分的经纬很简单，首先天蛾人被“暴雨”击溃了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我记得……大概是第四次“暴雨”后？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_at_30.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_at_30\"><img alt=\"3_7_at_30\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/Cg-3_7_at_30.png/600px-Cg-3_7_at_30.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/Cg-3_7_at_30.png/900px-Cg-3_7_at_30.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/Cg-3_7_at_30.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_at_30.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天蛾人：</div><div>第一批实验体全部失去联络，我们彻底失败了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天蛾人：</div><div>计划已经确定被终止了，这间安全屋一小时后就会被废弃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天蛾人：</div><div>剩下的实验体怎么办？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天蛾人：</div><div>我们的最后工作只有销毁记录。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-533810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-533810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-533810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>……再见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天蛾人：</div><div>待在这。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-314710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-314710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-314710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>然后它们取走了电视机，我在一片漆黑的房间里等待了大概三天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314716.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-314716.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314716.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314716.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-314716.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314716.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-314716.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314716.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我在没有得到指令的情况下睡着了三次，应该是三天？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_at_34.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_at_34\"><img alt=\"3_7_at_34\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-3_7_at_34.png/600px-Cg-3_7_at_34.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-3_7_at_34.png/900px-Cg-3_7_at_34.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-3_7_at_34.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_at_34.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天蛾人：</div><div>我向你推荐这个实验体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天蛾人：</div><div>我可以保证她的能力，她是最优秀、最忠诚的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_at_35.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_at_35\"><img alt=\"3_7_at_35\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-3_7_at_35.png/600px-Cg-3_7_at_35.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-3_7_at_35.png/900px-Cg-3_7_at_35.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-3_7_at_35.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_at_35.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>哦？我会很期待的，她叫什么名字？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天蛾人：</div><div>她没有名字，代号也已经废弃了，你可以随你喜欢地称呼她。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_at_43.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_at_43\"><img alt=\"3_7_at_43\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/Cg-3_7_at_43.png/600px-Cg-3_7_at_43.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/Cg-3_7_at_43.png/900px-Cg-3_7_at_43.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/Cg-3_7_at_43.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_at_43.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>那么，你就叫……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_at_38.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_at_38\"><img alt=\"3_7_at_38\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/Cg-3_7_at_38.png/600px-Cg-3_7_at_38.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/Cg-3_7_at_38.png/900px-Cg-3_7_at_38.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/Cg-3_7_at_38.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_at_38.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-314711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-314711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-314711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>结果我就这样加入了基金会，成为了康斯坦丁的养女。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>在我看来，你只是被天蛾人绑架了，又被卖给了基金会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>请不要这么说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>收留一个无家可归、没有记忆的孩子，为她提供教育和工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>这和第一防线学校的所作所为没有什么区别，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你可以保留这个观点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>接下来请你讲述你在基金会的生活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>你不好奇天蛾人与基金会之间的关系吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>这二者之间的秘密有助于我了解你吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我想不会？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>那么我就没有兴趣，审问间谍并不是我的工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>不如聊聊你的养母？那位康斯坦丁女士？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我明白了，你喜欢温情故事胜过间谍小说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……亲子关系是了解精神问题的一个好切入点，仅此而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>噢！不好意思，我习惯把问题的焦点转移给他人——一种职业病。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>你真的是一位恪尽职守的人，小梅斯梅尔小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>那就来讲讲我慈爱又严厉的养母……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"gaocengbangongshi\"><img alt=\"gaocengbangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png/600px-Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png/900px-Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>从今天起，你就是我的女儿了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>告诉我，你都能做些什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我可以用神秘术把记忆变成蛾子，然后传递它们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我还可以扮成任何人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>展示给我看，对我用你的神秘术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年幼的特工毫不犹豫地向眼前的大人伸出手，接着在手掌触碰的地方，停立着一只之前不存在的蛾子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>非常优秀，我没有任何遭受神秘术的感觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>而且你对于这条指令没有犹豫，即使我是你将来的家长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>不遵从命令是不对的，而不正确的事令我恶心和不适。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>那如果我命令你杀死我呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>您想要如何去死？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>看来他们把你教导得很好，或许我该借鉴一些他们的经验。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>这就是我取得康斯坦丁的信任，成为她的直属特工的故事的开端。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>再往后会涉及很多康斯坦丁的秘密，我建议基金会的部分到此为止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>要不要看看我在重塑之手的潜伏生活？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>在这之前，先回答我一个问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你怎么看待康斯坦丁女士和基金会？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>在康斯坦丁身边的生活非常轻松，她会在我表现良好时赞赏我，这对一个孩子来说很受用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>而且在基金会，我不用去分辨各种色彩，到处都是白色的环境色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>这里简直是天蛾人卡通片中的白色部分——宁静、和平。笑容不曾从我脸上消失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我想这算是段快乐的记忆。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "无路可返-03"}}